          <Icon name="sparkles" size={15} /> Strategic Takeaway for Computational Biology
        </div>
        <p>
          The ENCODE 4 culmination provides the ultimate training ground and empirical truth for the next generation of <strong>Foundation Regulatory Sequence Models</strong> (e.g. Borzoi, AlphaGenome, GPN-Star). By integrating base-pair sequence models (ChromBPNet), kinetic transcript dynamics (Bru-seq), single-cell pseudo-bulks, and 10 bp Intact Hi-C topologies, ENCODE 4 bridges the historical divide between molecular assays, evolutionary constraint, and human disease genetics.
        </p>
